This companion contains a maintained Java port of display-power logic from scrcpy.

scrcpy is Copyright (C) 2018 Genymobile and contributors and is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The upstream project is available at:
https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy

The port is isolated in DisplayPower.java and retains the upstream physical
display token, Android 14 DisplayControl fallback, and POWER_MODE_NORMAL logic.
